{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Inspired by Banksy's\u00a0<i>Flying Balloon Girl,</i>\u00a0I'm developing a game solo - because this story needs to be told. It\u2019s more than just a game; it\u2019s a journey that demands to be experienced.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2817920/extras/Gif_4.gif?t=1744006993\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A Fight for Survival</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the shoes of Sara, separated from her family in a brutal conflict. To reunite with them, she must navigate the ruins of a shattered world, using stealth and puzzle-solving to evade enemy drones and a terrifying secret weapon that hunts her every move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2817920/extras/Gif_3.gif?t=1744006993\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2817920/extras/Gif_2.gif?t=1744006993\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Cinematic Exploration</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a thrid person exploration game where you traverse haunting landscapes, decaying cities, and uncovering clues about your loved ones. Strange balloons hint at a deeper mystery, drawing you into a gripping journey of hope and resilience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A Haunting Soundtrack</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A stirring, evocative score intensifies every moment, immersing you in a world forever changed by greed and destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\